OL,3,GNEWSACharity football match to honour
OL,4,Aboxing legend Hatton
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity football match in memory of
OL,7,Fboxing legend Ricky Hatton will take
OL,8,Fplace later.
OL,10,FGame 4 Ricky, at City Football
OL,11,FAcademy's Joie Stadium, will feature
OL,12,Fcelebrities, ex-professional
OL,13,Ffootballers and boxers playing in teams
OL,14,Fcaptained by Hatton's son Campbell and
OL,15,Fbrother Matthew.
OL,17,FHyde boxer Ricky Hatton - known as "The
OL,18,FHitman" - won world titles at
OL,19,Flight-welterweight and welterweight and
OL,20,Fwas one of Britain's most popular
OL,21,Ffighters. He died last year aged 46.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
